## RMM Deployment Commands

### Option 1: Full Auto-Detect
```powershell
# Download and execute - auto-detects Eaglesoft version
[Net.ServicePointManager]::SecurityProtocol = [Net.SecurityProtocolType]::Tls12
$scriptUrl = "https://your-rmm-server/scripts/Deploy-SchickSensor.ps1"
$scriptPath = "$env:TEMP\Deploy-SchickSensor.ps1"
Invoke-WebRequest -Uri $scriptUrl -OutFile $scriptPath -UseBasicParsing
& $scriptPath
exit $LASTEXITCODE
```

### Option 2: Force Legacy Mode
```powershell
& $scriptPath -InstallMode Legacy -Verbose
```

### Option 3: Force IOSS Mode
```powershell
& $scriptPath -InstallMode IOSS -Verbose
```

### Option 4: Skip Prerequisites (if already handled)
```powershell
& $scriptPath -SkipPrerequisites
```

