## Decision Logic Summary

```
Eaglesoft Version Check:
├── >= 24.20 → IOSS Installation
│   ├── Downloads: IOSS_Autorun.exe, CDR Elite Setup.exe, CDRPatch-2808.msi, MSXML4
│   ├── Process: 
│   │   1. Install CDR Elite (for DLLs)
│   │   2. Clean Shared Files (preserve CDRData.dll + OMEGADLL.dll)
│   │   3. Install CDR Patch
│   │   4. Install IOSS
│   │   5. Configure IOSS service
│   └── WARNING: RDP acquisition NOT supported
│
└── < 24.20 → Legacy Installation
    ├── Downloads: CDR Elite Setup.exe, CDRPatch-2808.msi, MSXML4, (AEUSBInterface if USB 3.0)
    └── Process:
        1. Install CDR Elite
        2. Install CDR Patch
        3. Install AE USB driver (if USB 3.0 detected)
```

