## Troubleshooting

| Issue | Cause | Resolution |
|-------|-------|------------|
| IOSS service won't start | Prerequisites not loaded | Set to Delayed Start, reboot |
| Sensor not detected | AutoDetect interference | Uninstall legacy CDR drivers |
| CDRImageProcess.dll wrong version | Patch ran before MSXML | Re-run CDRPatch-2808.msi |
| Silent install prompts | File not unblocked | Ensure `Unblock-File` ran |
| Download fails | TLS 1.2 not enabled | Add `[Net.ServicePointManager]::SecurityProtocol = [Net.SecurityProtocolType]::Tls12` |

